      "sentenceId": "s_0001",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.2,
      "text": "Welcome back to the show. Today we're talking about small habits.",
      "translation": "欢迎回来。今天我们聊聊小习惯。",
      "notes": "重音：back · habits；语速平稳，句尾降调。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0002",
      "start": 5,
      "end": 8,
      "text": "A small habit can change your whole day.",
      "translation": "一个小习惯能改变你的一整天。",
      "notes": "重音：small · change · whole；change 的 ay 音要饱满。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0003",
      "start": 8.8,
      "end": 12.2,
      "text": "Start with one thing you can do in two minutes.",
      "translation": "从一件两分钟就能做到的小事开始。",
      "notes": "重音：Start · one · two；two minutes 连读成 two-minutes。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0004",
      "start": 13,
      "end": 16,
      "text": "Then repeat it at the same time every day.",
      "translation": "然后在每天同一时间重复它。",
      "notes": "重音：repeat · same · every；at the 弱读成 at-thuh。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0005",
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 19.6,
      "text": "That's how progress becomes automatic.",
      "translation": "进步就是这样变成自动的。",
      "notes": "重音：progress · automatic；automatic 重音在 ma。"
